ervation is correct - there's a code path where positions get cleared but algo orders don't get cleaned up.\n\nLet me fix the code for the 5-minute sync path.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"找到问题了。看第 2347 行的 5 分钟 API 同步逻辑：\n\n**API 返回持仓为 0 时，只清空了本地缓存，但没有取消 Binance 上残留的 Algo 条件单。**\n\n这就是你要的场景 —— 如果持仓被外部手动平掉（或者网络抖动导致平仓成功但 bot 没收到确认），5 分钟后 API 同步发现 `api_count == 0`，代码只是 `positions = []` 就完事了，止盈止损单没人取消。\n\n修一下："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_IMrlJuBGS9IqPYQcK3J93005","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py","offset":2325,"limit":30}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":1604,"output":2126,"cacheRead":34432,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":38162,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780703415456}}
