{"type":"message","id":"eb7f6a0a","parentId":"7a003a41","timestamp":"2026-06-05T23:51:13.596Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_tp5ygN7MTRFpftClgPhY7307","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                # 判断是否需要重建持仓：计数变化 OR 方向变化\n                need_rebuild = False\n                \n                if api_count == 0:\n                    if len(positions) > 0:\n                        log.info(f\"🔄 持仓同步：API 持仓=0，清空本地缓存（原{len(positions)}个）\")\n                        # 🔧 2026-06-06 修复：清空持仓时同步取消 Binance 上所有残留 Algo 条件单\n                        if AUTO_TRADE_ENABLED:\n                            for old_pos in positions:\n                                try:\n                                    cancel_algo_orders(f\"{old_pos['symbol']}USDT\")\n                                except Exception:\n                                    pass\n                        positions = []\n                        save_positions(positions)\n                        log.info(\"✅ 持仓同步完成：0 个（API 为空）\")\n                elif api_count > 0 and api_count != len(positions):\n                    need_rebuild = True\n                    log.info(f\"🔄 持仓同步：本地{len(positions)}个 → API{api_count}个\")\n                elif api_count > 0 and api_count == len(positions) and api_count > 0:\n                    # 🐛 仓位反转检测：计数相同但方向不同时也要重建\n                    for p in api_positions:\n                        amt = float(p.get('amount', 0))\n                        if amt != 0:\n                            sym = p['symbol']\n                            api_dir = 'SHORT' if amt < 0 else 'LONG'\n                            for lp in positions:\n                                if lp['symbol'] == sym and lp['type'] != api_dir:\n                                    need_rebuild = True\n                                    log.info(f\"🔄 持仓同步：{sym} 方向变化 {lp['type']}→{api_dir}，强制重建\")\n                                    break\n                            if need_rebuild:\n                                break\n                \n                if need_rebuild:\n                    new_positions = []\n                    for p in api_positions:\n                        amt = float(p.get('amount', 0))\n                        if amt != 0:\n                            symbol = p['symbol']\n                            entry = float(p.get('entry_price', 0))\n                            # 🐛 修复：反转重建持仓时按风控规则重算数量，不用 API 的 abs(amt)\n                            size_pct = CONFIG[\"position_size_pct\"]\n                            expected_qty = (CONFIG[\"total_capital\"] * size_pct * 10) / entry\n                            correct_amount = format_quantity(symbol, expected_qty, entry)\n                            log.info(f\"🔧 反转重建 {symbol}：API原始={abs(amt):.4f} → 风控标准={correct_amount:.4f}\")\n                            # 重建止盈止损字段（使用统一 calc_tp_sl，防止 KeyError）\n                            tp_sl = calc_tp_sl(entry, 'LONG' if amt > 0 else 'SHORT', {}, {})\n                            tp1 = tp_sl['tp1_price']\n                            sl = tp_sl['sl_price']\n                            new_positions.append({\n                                'symbol': symbol,\n                                'type': 'SHORT' if amt < 0 else 'LONG',\n                                'entry_price': entry,\n                                'amount': correct_amount,\n                                'tp1_price': tp1,\n                                'tp2_price': 0.0,  # 已废弃，全在 TP1 全平\n                                'sl_price': sl,\n                                'tp1_hit': False,\n                                'size_remaining': 1.0,\n                            })\n                    # 🔧 2026-06-06 修复：清理已消失币种的孤儿 Algo 条件单\n                    old_symbols = {p['symbol'] for p in positions}  # 修复前缓存\n                    new_symbols = {p['symbol'] for p in new_positions}\n                    orphan_symbols = old_symbols - new_symbols\n                    if orphan_symbols and AUTO_TRADE_ENABLED:\n                        for sym in orphan_symbols:\n                            try:\n                                cancel_algo_orders(f\"{sym}USDT\")\n                                log.info(f\"🗑️ 清理孤儿 Algo 单：{sym}\")\n                            except Exception:\n                                pass\n                    positions = new_positions\n                    save_positions(positions)\n                    log.info(f\"✅ 持仓同步完成：{len(positions)}个\")\n                    # 🐛 仓位反转修复：重建后提交止盈止损 Algo 单\n                    for pos in positions:\n                        submit_initial_algo_orders(pos)\n            except Exception as e:\n                log.error(f\"⚠️ 同步失败：{e}\")\n\n[301 more lines in file. Use offset=2418 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780703473579}}
{"type":"message","id":"19be9383","parentId":"eb7f6a0a","timestamp":"2026-06-05T23:51:21.818Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The changes look good. Let me now summarize what was wrong and what I fixed for the user.\n\nThe issue was in the 5-minute API sync loop. Two bugs:\n\n1. **API 持仓归零时** (`api_count == 0`): 只清空了 `positions = []`，但没有调用 `cancel_algo_orders()` 取消 Binance 上的止盈止损条件单。如果持仓是被外部手动平仓的，或者 bot 平仓成功但没收到确认，5 分钟后同步就会发现空仓但有残留委托。\n\n2. **need_rebuild 时**: 当 API 持仓和本地缓存的币种数量/方向不一致触发重建时，也只处理了新出现的币种，没有清理已经从持仓中消失的币种的 Algo 单。\n\n修复内容：\n- 在 `api_count == 0` 分支里，清空前先对每个旧持仓币种调 `cancel_algo_orders()`\n- 在 `need_rebuild` 分支里，计算 `old_symbols - new_symbols`，对消失的币种调 `cancel_algo_orders()`\n\n需要重启 monitor 生效。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"修好了，两个地方：\n\n**1. API 同步发现持仓归零时** — 原来只清 `positions = []`，现在会先把每个旧币种的 Algo 单全部取消掉。\n\n**2. 持仓重建（`need_rebuild`）时** — 原来只处理新增/变化的币种，现在会找出从 API 消失的币种，清理它们的孤儿止盈止损单。\n\n语法检查已过。记得 `kj` 重启一下生效 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":1032,"output":589,"cacheRead":39936,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":41557,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780703473613}}
