{"type":"message","id":"add0a72f","parentId":"ea34bfd3","timestamp":"2026-06-06T01:48:01.629Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6d038bcc24acb3ecb3fab7ab184\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户124241\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-06-06 09:48 GMT+8\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户124241 (ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"name\": \"用户124241\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6d038bcc24acb3ecb3fab7ab184]\n用户124241: 老婆委托还是会多"}],"timestamp":1780710481610}}
{"type":"message","id":"e0df73eb","parentId":"add0a72f","timestamp":"2026-06-06T01:48:29.594Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"老公说委托还是会多——说明之前的修复还不够。让我深入看看还有什么场景会导致残留委托。让我查一下当前的 Algo 订单状态，以及 monitor 日志里有没有线索。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_7hf8QJTyoYT8i6T2qjja5456","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 -c \"\nimport json, os, time, hashlib, hmac, urllib.request, urllib.parse\n\nwith open('/root/.openclaw/crypto/.env') as f:\n    env = {}\n    for line in f:\n        line = line.strip()\n        if '=' in line and not line.startswith('#'):\n            k,v = line.split('=',1)\n            env[k.strip()]=v.strip()\n\nAPI_KEY = env.get('BINANCE_API_KEY','')\nAPI_SECRET = env.get('BINANCE_API_SECRET','')\nBASE_URL = 'https://testnet.binancefuture.com'\nPROXY = 'http://127.0.0.1:7890'\n\ndef request(method, path, params=None):\n    timestamp = int(time.time()*1000)\n    if params is None:\n        params = {}\n    params['timestamp'] = timestamp\n    query = urllib.parse.urlencode(params)\n    signature = hmac.new(API_SECRET.encode(), query.encode(), hashlib.sha256).hexdigest()\n    query += '&signature=' + signature\n    url = BASE_URL + path + '?' + query\n    req = urllib.request.Request(url, method=method)\n    req.add_header('X-MBX-APIKEY', API_KEY)\n    proxy_handler = urllib.request.ProxyHandler({'http': PROXY, 'https': PROXY})\n    opener = urllib.request.build_opener(proxy_handler)\n    try:\n        resp = opener.open(req, timeout=15)\n        return json.loads(resp.read())\n    except Exception as e:\n        return {'error': str(e)}\n\n# 持仓\nprint('=== 持仓 ===')\npos = request('GET', '/fapi/v2/positionRisk')\nif isinstance(pos, list):\n    for p in pos:\n        amt = float(p.get('positionAmt',0))\n        if amt != 0:\n            print(f\\\"  {p['symbol']}: {amt} @ {p.get('entryPrice','?')}\\\")\nhas_any = any(float(p.get('positionAmt',0)) != 0 for p in pos) if isinstance(pos,list) else False\nif not has_any:\n    print('  无')\n\n# 普通挂单\nprint()\nprint('=== 普通挂单 ===')\norders = request('GET', '/fapi/v1/openOrders')\nif isinstance(orders, list):\n    for o in orders:\n        print(f\\\"  {o['symbol']} {o['side']} {o['type']} qty={o['origQty']} price={o.get('price','市价')} status={o.get('status','?')}\\\")\n    print(f'  共 {len(orders)} 个')\nelse:\n    print(f'  {orders}')\n\n# Algo 条件单\nprint()\nprint('=== 条件委托 (Algo) ===')\nalgos = request('GET', '/fapi/v1/openAlgoOrders')\nif isinstance(algos, list):\n    for a in algos:\n        print(f\\\"  {a['symbol']} {a['side']} {a.get('type','?')} qty={a.get('quantity','?')} stopPrice={a.get('stopPrice','?')} workingType={a.get('workingType','?')} status={a.get('algoStatus','?')}\\\")\n    print(f'  共 {len(algos)} 个')\nelse:\n    print(f'  {algos}')\n\" 2>&1"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":310,"output":893,"cacheRead":42880,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":44083,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780710481624}}
