{"type":"message","id":"dc4b7b17","parentId":"c76174c2","timestamp":"2026-06-06T01:54:06.443Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me also fix the checks at line 1070 and 2082, and the SL recovery logic at 2485, 2493, 2511, 2564, 2612, 2678. These are checking for position existence, and dust positions would cause false positives.\n\nActually, line 1070 is in the pre-open check - `if any(p.get(\"symbol\") == symbol and float(p.get(\"amount\", 0)) != 0 for p in _api_pos)` - this checks if a position already exists before opening a new one. Dust would trigger a false \"already has position\" and prevent opening.\n\nLine 2082 is in the AI prediction function - `if amt != 0:` when building a summary of current positions.\n\nThe SL recovery checks at 2485, 2493, 2511 are critical because they determine if the SL close was successful.\n\nLet me fix the critical ones. The pre-open check (1070) and the AI position summary (2082) should also filter dust.\n\nLet me approach this differently - create a helper function `_is_valid_position(p)` and use it everywhere:","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_AS7vCoHlyygQZFj5SFxf8248","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"sed -n '1065,1080p' /root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":397,"output":547,"cacheRead":70400,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":71344,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780710838232}}
{"type":"message","id":"1a618fc4","parentId":"dc4b7b17","timestamp":"2026-06-06T01:54:06.651Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_AS7vCoHlyygQZFj5SFxf8248","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":") -> dict:\n    # 2026-04-27 老公指示：下单前最后一道闸门 —— Binance API 实时确认无同币种持仓\n    # 防止多进程/race condition 重复开仓（之前 12 秒内开 2 次 XRP / SSL EOF 后又开一次 BNB 都是这个 bug）\n    try:\n        _api_pos = get_all_positions() or []\n        if any(p.get(\"symbol\") == symbol and float(p.get(\"amount\", 0)) != 0 for p in _api_pos):\n            log.warning(f\"🚫 {symbol} 下单闸门：API 已有持仓，拒绝重复下单\")\n            return {\n                \"symbol\": symbol, \"type\": direction, \"entry_price\": entry_price,\n                \"qty\": 0, \"amount\": 0, \"score\": score, \"regime\": regime,\n                \"ai_result\": ai_result,\n                \"order_result\": {\"success\": False, \"message\": \"API 已有持仓，拒绝重复下单\"},\n                \"entry_time\": datetime.now().isoformat(),\n                \"high_24h\": 0.0, \"low_24h\": 0.0, \"peak_pnl\": 0.0,\n                **tp_sl,\n            }"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":114,"aggregated":") -> dict:\n    # 2026-04-27 老公指示：下单前最后一道闸门 —— Binance API 实时确认无同币种持仓\n    # 防止多进程/race condition 重复开仓（之前 12 秒内开 2 次 XRP / SSL EOF 后又开一次 BNB 都是这个 bug）\n    try:\n        _api_pos = get_all_positions() or []\n        if any(p.get(\"symbol\") == symbol and float(p.get(\"amount\", 0)) != 0 for p in _api_pos):\n            log.warning(f\"🚫 {symbol} 下单闸门：API 已有持仓，拒绝重复下单\")\n            return {\n                \"symbol\": symbol, \"type\": direction, \"entry_price\": entry_price,\n                \"qty\": 0, \"amount\": 0, \"score\": score, \"regime\": regime,\n                \"ai_result\": ai_result,\n                \"order_result\": {\"success\": False, \"message\": \"API 已有持仓，拒绝重复下单\"},\n                \"entry_time\": datetime.now().isoformat(),\n                \"high_24h\": 0.0, \"low_24h\": 0.0, \"peak_pnl\