{"type":"message","id":"d9063493","parentId":"cc34b9f1","timestamp":"2026-06-06T02:00:42.423Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK monitor 在跑，当前 DOT SHORT 持仓 @ 0.955，现价 0.946，浮盈 +1.68U。没有出现委托残留问题，看起来之前的修复起效了。\n\n现在我需要审视代码逻辑，看看核心流程能不能跑通：\n\n1. 开仓流程\n2. 止盈止损 Algo 委托提交\n3. 止盈止损触发 → 平仓 → 取消委托\n4. 5 分钟 API 同步中持仓归零 → 取消委托\n5. 粉尘持仓过滤\n\n让我先跑一次开仓预览（dry run），验证逻辑能走通，然后再实际测试。\n\n先跑一次信号计算看看当前有没有开仓信号。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"状态正常，DOT SHORT 浮盈中。现在按阶段验证核心逻辑。\n\n**第 1 步：验证开仓评分 → 信号 → 下单流程**"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_x005BLSntR9HPv5Rkzde3131","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 -c \"\nimport json, sys\nsys.path.insert(0, '.')\n\n# 快速验证：读取持仓 + 检查信号计算\nwith open('crypto_positions.json') as f:\n    pos = json.load(f)\nprint(f'📊 本地持仓: {len(pos)} 个')\n\n# 检查 monitor 是否正常输出日志\nimport subprocess\nresult = subprocess.run(['tail', '-3', '/root/.openclaw/logs/trading/monitor.log'], \n                       capture_output=True, text=True)\nprint(result.stdout.strip())\n\" 2>&1"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":616,"output":521,"cacheRead":87680,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":88817,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780711233350}}
