{"type":"message","id":"f89814b3","parentId":"8735e3cd","timestamp":"2026-06-06T02:02:34.352Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_ET_sBS6uwTCBmHLC1AqDdG31654","toolName":"process","content":[{"type":"text","text":"ETH 现价: 1581.0\nETH SHORT: qty=0.127 tp=1517.76 sl=1612.62\n杠杆设置: 10x\n\n🔴 开空 ETH...\n下单: orderId=9230554514 status=NEW\n持仓确认: ETHUSDT -0.127 @ 1581.0\n\n📌 提交 Algo 委托...\n  止损: 1000000097334432 trigger=1612.62 qty=0.127\n  止盈: 1000000097334440 trigger=1517.76 qty=0.127\n\n=== 最终状态 ===\n持仓: ETH -0.127 @ 1581.0\nAlgo 委托: 2 个\n  ETHUSDT TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET algoId=1000000097334440 stopPrice=None\n  ETHUSDT STOP_MARKET algoId=1000000097334432 stopPrice=None\n\n✅ 开仓→委托下发→API验证 全链路通过\n\nProcess exited with code 0."}],"details":{"status":"completed","sessionId":"crisp-valley","exitCode":0,"aggregated":"ETH 现价: 1581.0\nETH SHORT: qty=0.127 tp=1517.76 sl=1612.62\n杠杆设置: 10x\n\n🔴 开空 ETH...\n下单: orderId=9230554514 status=NEW\n持仓确认: ETHUSDT -0.127 @ 1581.0\n\n📌 提交 Algo 委托...\n  止损: 1000000097334432 trigger=1612.62 qty=0.127\n  止盈: 1000000097334440 trigger=1517.76 qty=0.127\n\n=== 最终状态 ===\n持仓: ETH -0.127 @ 1581.0\nAlgo 委托: 2 个\n  ETHUSDT TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET algoId=1000000097334440 stopPrice=None\n  ETHUSDT STOP_MARKET algoId=1000000097334432 stopPrice=None\n\n✅ 开仓→委托下发→API验证 全链路通过\n","name":"cd /root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1780711354338}}
{"type":"message","id":"dbdd109b","parentId":"f89814b3","timestamp":"2026-06-06T02:02:46.951Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good - the open + dispatch flow works. Now let me also verify that the monitor picks up the new position correctly, and that it doesn't generate duplicate algo orders.\n\nBut first, let me also test: close this ETH position, then verify the monitor's 5-minute sync cleans up the algo orders.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"开仓 → 委托自动下发 ✅。现在测**监听到平仓后的自动清理**——关掉 ETH，等 monitor 同步："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_CvR7Ndxo2gEvfsCfPJ9M9008","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 -c \"\nimport json, time, hashlib, hmac, urllib.request\n\nwith open('auto_trade_config.json') as f:\n    cfg = json.load(f)\n\nAPI_KEY = cfg['binance_api']['api_key']\nAPI_SECRET = cfg['binance_api']['secret_key']\nBASE_URL = 'https://testnet.binancefuture.com'\nPROXY = 'http://127.0.0.1:7890'\n\ndef request(method, path, params=None):\n    timestamp = int(time.time()*1000)\n    if params is None:\n        params = {}\n    params['timestamp'] = timestamp\n    query = urllib.parse.urlencode(params)\n    signature = hmac.new(API_SECRET.encode(), query.encode(), hashlib.sha256).hexdigest()\n    query += '&signature=' + signature\n    url = BASE_URL + path + '?' + query\n    req = urllib.request.Request(url, method=method)\n    req.add_header('X-MBX-APIKEY', API_KEY)\n    proxy_handler = urllib.request.ProxyHandler({'http': PROXY, 'https': PROXY})\n    opener = urllib.request.build_opener(proxy_handler)\n    try:\n        resp = opener.open(req, timeout=15)\n        return json.loads(resp.read())\n    except Exception as e:\n        return {'error': str(e)}\n\n# 平仓 ETH\nprint('🔄 平仓 ETH SHORT...')\nresult = request('POST', '/fapi/v1/order', {\n    'symbol': 'ETHUSDT', 'side': 'BUY', 'type': 'MARKET', 'quantity': '0.127',\n})\nprint(f'平仓: orderId={result.get(\\\"orderId\\\",\\\"?\\\")}')\n\ntime.sleep(2)\n\n# 确认\npos = request('GET', '/fapi/v2/positionRisk')\namt = 0\nif isinstance(pos, list):\n    for p in pos:\n        if p['symbol'] == 'ETHUSDT':\n            amt = float(p.get('positionAmt',0))\nprint(f'ETH 持仓: {amt}')\n\n# 当前 Algo 委托（应该还有 ETH 的 2 个）\nalgos = request('GET', '/fapi/v1/openAlgoOrders')\nprint(f'当前 Algo: {len(algos) if isinstance(algos,list) else \\\"?\\\"} 个')\nif isinstance(algos, list):\n    for a in algos:\n        print(f'  {a[\\\"symbol\\\"]} {a.get(\\\"orderType\\\")} algoId={a.get(\\\"algoId\\\")}')\n\nprint()\nprint('⏳ 等待 monitor 5 分钟同步清理...')\nprint('monitor 会在 api_count==0 时自动调用 cancel_algo_orders')\nprint('可以手动 tail -f /root/.openclaw/logs/trading/monitor.log 观察')\n\" 2>&1"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":336,"output":850,"cacheRead":93312,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":94498,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780711354365}}
