{"type":"message","id":"9cda6351","parentId":"00ebfbc9","timestamp":"2026-06-06T02:03:20.698Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I see - the monitor synced at 7:34 and 8:13/8:17, but the last sync was before our manual close. Let me check if there's a newer log.\n\nWait, looking at the timestamps: the monitor was restarted at 08:17. The syncs after that should be at approximately 08:22, 08:27, 08:32, etc. But I only see startup syncs at 08:13 and 08:17. Let me check if the 5-minute syncs are being logged.\n\nActually, looking at the sync logic: `if scheduler.tick % 20 == 0`. The tick increments every 15 seconds or so. Let me check if there are recent syncs after the restart. Actually the monitor restarted at 08:17, so the first sync (tick 0) is at startup, then tick 20 would be at around 08:22, tick 40 at 08:27, etc.\n\nBut the log doesn't show \"持仓同步\" for the later ticks. That's because the sync only logs when there's a CHANGE. If api_count == len(positions), it may not log anything (or log at a lower level).\n\nAnyway, I manually closed DOT and ETH. Let me manually clean up the ETH orders now since they're orphans, and then focus on validating that the monitor correctly handles the empty state.\n\nActually, let me focus on what matters: verifying the full flow works end-to-end. I've proven:\n1. Open position → algo orders properly submitted ✅\n2. Close position manually → algo orders remain (expected)\n3. The fix should clean them up at next sync\n\nLet me now clean up ETH algo orders manually, wait a few minutes, then check if monitor handles the empty state correctly.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_QPtq5pr2SRYagVhvPbm94875","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 -c \"\nimport json, time, hashlib, hmac, urllib.request\n\nwith open('auto_trade_config.json') as f:\n    cfg = json.load(f)\n\nAPI_KEY = cfg['binance_api']['api_key']\nAPI_SECRET = cfg['binance_api']['secret_key']\nBASE_URL = 'https://testnet.binancefuture.com'\nPROXY = 'http://127.0.0.1:7890'\n\ndef request(method, path, params=None):\n    timestamp = int(time.time()*1000)\n    if params is None: params = {}\n    params['timestamp'] = timestamp\n    query = urllib.parse.urlencode(params)\n    signature = hmac.new(API_SECRET.encode(), query.encode(), hashlib.sha256).hexdigest()\n    query += '&signature=' + signature\n    url = BASE_URL + path + '?' + query\n    req = urllib.request.Request(url, method=method)\n    req.add_header('X-MBX-APIKEY', API_KEY)\n    proxy_handler = urllib.request.ProxyHandler({'http': PROXY, 'https': PROXY})\n    opener = urllib.request.build_opener(proxy_handler)\n    resp = opener.open(req, timeout=15)\n    return json.loads(resp.read())\n\n# 清理 ETH 孤儿单\nalgos = request('GET', '/fapi/v1/openAlgoOrders')\nfor a in algos if isinstance(algos, list) else []:\n    if 'ETH' in a.get('symbol', ''):\n        r = request('DELETE', '/fapi/v1/algoOrder', {'algoId': a['algoId']})\n        print(f'🗑️ 清理 ETH {a.get(\\\"orderType\\\")}: {r.get(\\\"code\\\",\\\"?\\\")}')\n\n# 最终状态\npos = request('GET', '/fapi/v2/positionRisk')\nhas_pos = any(float(p.get('positionAmt',0)) != 0 for p in pos) if isinstance(pos,list) else False\nalgos_final = request('GET', '/fapi/v1/openAlgoOrders')\nprint(f'持仓: {\\\"有\\\" if has_pos else \\\"无\\\"}')\nprint(f'Algo: {len(algos_final) if isinstance(algos_final,list) else \\\"?\\\"} 个')\n\" 2>&1"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":467,"output":1327,"cacheRead":94848,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":96642,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780711382503}}
