{"type":"message","id":"7cd0712a","parentId":"7328419b","timestamp":"2026-06-06T05:24:49.535Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Wait, the output shows only 1 position (BTC SHORT -0.003) and 2 algo orders. But earlier we had ETH LONG and LINK SHORT positions too. Let me check:\n\n- SOL was the extra position (cleaned up)\n- BTC -0.003 is a SHORT position\n- ETH and LINK positions should still be there\n\nWait, there should have been ETH SHORT and LINK SHORT from the monitor's earlier trades. Let me check again.\n\nActually, maybe they were already closed. The monitor log showed only SOL was re-opened after TP1. Let me check the current state more carefully.\n\nWait, actually the output says only BTC SHORT -0.003. Something seems off. Let me check all positions and also verify ETH and LINK.\n\nActually, looking back at the monitor log timestamps:\n- 11:17:54 ETH SHORT\n- 11:27:18 LINK SHORT\n- 12:31:28 SOL TP1 closed\n\nMaybe ETH and LINK were already closed by TP/SL? Let me check.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_4jDEQiqDA3r2ewL5cCM10196","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 -c \"\nimport json, time, hashlib, hmac, urllib.request\n\nwith open('auto_trade_config.json') as f:\n    cfg = json.load(f)\nAPI_KEY = cfg['binance_api']['api_key']\nAPI_SECRET = cfg['binance_api']['secret_key']\nBASE = 'https://testnet.binancefuture.com'\nPROXY = 'http://127.0.0.1:7890'\n\ndef req(m, p, d=None):\n    ts = int(time.time()*1000)\n    d = d or {}\n    d['timestamp'] = ts\n    q = urllib.parse.urlencode(d)\n    sig = hmac.new(API_SECRET.encode(), q.encode(), hashlib.sha256).hexdigest()\n    u = BASE + p + '?' + q + '&signature=' + sig\n    r = urllib.request.Request(u, method=m)\n    r.add_header('X-MBX-APIKEY', API_KEY)\n    h = urllib.request.ProxyHandler({'http': PROXY, 'https': PROXY})\n    return json.loads(urllib.request.build_opener(h).open(r, timeout=15).read())\n\n# 完整持仓\nprint('=== 持仓 ===')\nps = req('GET', '/fapi/v2/positionRisk')\nfor p in (ps if isinstance(ps,list) else []):\n    a = p.get('positionAmt','0')\n    if a.startswith('0') or a.startswith('-0'):\n        pass  # skip zeros\n    else:\n        a2 = float(a)\n        if a2 != 0:\n            entry = float(p.get('entryPrice',0))\n            notional = abs(a2) * entry\n            print(f'  {p[\\\"symbol\\\"]}: {a2} @ \\${entry}  名义 \\${notional:.1f}')\n\nprint()\nprint('=== Algo ===')\nal = req('GET', '/fapi/v1/openAlgoOrders')\nprint(f'  共 {len(al) if isinstance(al,list) else \\\"?\\\"} 个')\nif isinstance(al, list):\n    for a in al:\n        print(f'  {a[\\\"symbol\\\"]} {a.get(\\\"orderType\\\")}')\n\n# 查看余额\nprint()\nbal = req('GET', '/fapi/v2/balance')\nif isinstance(bal, list):\n    for b in bal:\n        if b['asset'] == 'USDT':\n            print(f'  余额: {float(b[\\\"balance\\\"]):.2f} USDT')\n            print(f'  可用: {float(b[\\\"availableBalance\\\"]):.2f} USDT')\n\" 2>&1"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":181,"output":1086,"cacheRead":74880,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":76147,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780723474976}}
