{"type":"message","id":"3aa7b214","parentId":"f06f53a0","timestamp":"2026-06-06T05:25:05.286Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Interesting - only BTC SHORT is left! All the other positions (ETH, LINK, DOT) were closed. The BTC SHORT is -0.003 @ about $61,788 (from the earlier trade). \n\nBut wait - the position listing shows nothing, but Algo shows BTC has TP and SL. That means the API is returning positions but the code to display them might have an issue. Let me re-check.\n\nActually looking more carefully, the Python code has:\n```python\nif a.startswith('0') or a.startswith('-0'):\n    pass  # skip zeros\n```\n\nThis skips `0.0` and `-0.0`. But `-0.003` starts with `-0`, so it would be skipped! That's a bug in my quick script. The BTC position IS there but being filtered out by my naive check.\n\nLet me fix the display.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_DI6lJPVjzayNRmtpx9i59533","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 -c \"\nimport json, time, hashlib, hmac, urllib.request\n\nwith open('auto_trade_config.json') as f:\n    cfg = json.load(f)\nAPI_KEY = cfg['binance_api']['api_key']\nAPI_SECRET = cfg['binance_api']['secret_key']\nBASE = 'https://testnet.binancefuture.com'\nPROXY = 'http://127.0.0.1:7890'\n\ndef req(m, p, d=None):\n    ts = int(time.time()*1000)\n    d = d or {}\n    d['timestamp'] = ts\n    q = urllib.parse.urlencode(d)\n    sig = hmac.new(API_SECRET.encode(), q.encode(), hashlib.sha256).hexdigest()\n    u = BASE + p + '?' + q + '&signature=' + sig\n    r = urllib.request.Request(u, method=m)\n    r.add_header('X-MBX-APIKEY', API_KEY)\n    h = urllib.request.ProxyHandler({'http': PROXY, 'https': PROXY})\n    return json.loads(urllib.request.build_opener(h).open(r, timeout=15).read())\n\nps = req('GET', '/fapi/v2/positionRisk')\ncount = 0\nfor p in (ps if isinstance(ps,list) else []):\n    a = float(p.get('positionAmt','0'))\n    if abs(a) > 0:\n        entry = float(p.get('entryPrice',0))\n        notional = abs(a) * entry\n        margin = float(p.get('isolatedWallet','0'))\n        count += 1\n        typ = 'LONG' if a > 0 else 'SHORT'\n        print(f'{typ} {p[\\\"symbol\\\"]}: {a} @ \\${entry:.2f}  名义 \\${notional:.1f}  保证金 \\${margin:.2f}')\n\nif count == 0:\n    print('无持仓')\n\" 2>&1"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":93,"output":858,"cacheRead":75904,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":76855,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780723493589}}
