{"type":"message","id":"ab9ef0d2","parentId":"a6918515","timestamp":"2026-06-06T05:31:44.613Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"老公问具体要改哪些文件，以及放宽止盈后移动止盈止损怎么设置。\n\n让我理清当前系统的止盈止损逻辑：\n\n1. **固定止盈**：`TAKE_PROFIT_PCT = 0.04`（4%）在 crypto_signal_monitor.py 的 calc_tp_sl 函数中\n2. **止损**：已经用了 ATR 动态计算（ATR 分层倍数 1.0/1.5/2.0）\n3. **移动止盈**：三档（+2%/0.8%, +3%/2%, +4%/全平）\n\n如果要改：\n- calc_tp_sl 函数中的止盈计算逻辑\n- ATR 止损分层倍数（已经 1.0/1.5/2.0，止盈可以对应调整）\n- 移动止盈的三档阈值也需要跟着调\n\n让我先读代码确认具体位置。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"让我先读代码确认所有需要改的位置。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_g3sYC9g1uNSkm5AF7wMb2656","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"grep -n \"TAKE_PROFIT_PCT\\|calc_tp_sl\\|移动止盈\\|tp1 =\" /root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py | head -20"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":572,"output":497,"cacheRead":83584,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":84653,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780723897284}}
{"type":"message","id":"28ea62db","parentId":"ab9ef0d2","timestamp":"2026-06-06T05:31:44.786Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_g3sYC9g1uNSkm5AF7wMb2656","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"5:优化：WebSocket实时价格 + 分层扫描 + 市场状态识别 + 移动止盈 + 熔断保护\n83:    # 移动止盈 - 2026-03-30 老公指示：关闭移动止盈，严格固定 -2% 止损\n84:    # 2026-03-30 老公指示：三档移动止盈（回撤比例）\n572:def calc_tp_sl(\n587:    TAKE_PROFIT_PCT = 0.04  # 2026-03-30 老公指示：改回 4%（8U）\n602:        tp1 = entry * (1 + TAKE_PROFIT_PCT)\n605:        tp1 = entry * (1 - TAKE_PROFIT_PCT)\n611:        \"peak_pnl\":  0.0,   # 移动止盈用\n632:        tp1 = pos[\"tp1_price\"]\n636:        if tp1 == 0.0 or sl == 0.0:\n658:    移动止盈 - 2026-03-30 老公指示：三档移动止盈（从峰值价回撤）\n2091:                        tp1 = round(entry * 1.03, 4) if is_long else round(entry * 0.97, 4)\n2256:                    tp_sl = calc_tp_sl(entry, direction, {}, {})  # 重新计算，不保留旧缓存\n2337:    # 应用恢复的 peak_pnl 到持仓（移动止盈关键数据）\n2421:                            # 重建止盈止损字段（使用统一 calc_tp_sl，防止 KeyError）\n2422:                            tp_sl = calc_tp_sl(entry, 'LONG' if amt > 0 else 'SHORT', {}, {})\n2423:                            tp1 = tp_sl['tp1_price']\n2537:            # 移动止盈更新\n2707:                        tp_sl = calc_tp_sl(entry, direction, ind, pd)\n2741:            # 保存状态（包含 peak_pnl 用于移动止盈）"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":110,"aggregated":"5:优化：WebSocket实时价格 + 分层扫描 + 市场状态识别 + 移动止盈 + 熔断保护\n83:    # 移动止盈 - 2026-03-30 老公指示：关闭移动止盈，严格固定 -2% 止损\n84:    # 2026-03-30 老公指示：三档移动止盈（回撤比例）\n572:def calc_tp_sl(\n587:    TAKE_PROFIT_PCT = 0.04  # 2026-03-30 老公指示：改回 4%（8U）\n602:        tp1 = entry * (1 + TAKE_PROFIT_PCT)\n605:        tp1 = entry * (1 - TAKE_PROFIT_PCT)\n611:        \"peak_pnl\":  0.0,   # 移动止盈用\n632:        tp1 = pos[\"tp1_price\"]\n636:        if tp1 == 0.0 or sl == 0.0:\n658:    移动止盈 - 2026-03-30 老公指示：三档移动止盈（从峰值价回撤）\n2091:                        tp1 = round(entry * 1.03, 4) if is_long else round(entry * 0.97, 4)\n2256:                    tp_sl = calc_tp_sl(entry, direction, {}, {})  # 重新计算，不保留旧缓存\n2337:    # 应用恢复的 peak_pnl 到持仓（移动止盈关键数据）\n2421:                            # 重建止盈止损字段（使用统一 calc_tp_sl，防止 KeyError）\n2422:                            tp_sl = calc_tp_sl(entry, 'LONG' if amt > 0 else 'SHORT', {}, {})\n2423:                            tp1 = tp_sl['tp1_price']\n2537:            # 移动止盈更新\n2707:                        tp_sl = calc_tp_sl(entry, direction, ind, pd)\n2741:            # 保存状态（包含 peak_pnl 用于移动止盈）","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1780723904775}}
{"type":"message","id":"761ba1f0","parentId":"28ea62db","timestamp":"2026-06-06T05:31:48.293Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me read the calc_tp_sl function and the trailing stop logic in detail:","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_1pOIReWCwjY8swJJGwKB2161","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py","offset":572,"limit":60}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":579,"output":130,"cacheRead":84352,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":85061,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780723904795}}
{"type":"message","id":"0e6ce917","parentId":"761ba1f0","timestamp":"2026-06-06T05:31:48.417Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_1pOIReWCwjY8swJJGwKB2161","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"def calc_tp_sl(\n    entry: float,\n    direction: str,\n    ind: dict,\n    price_data: dict,\n) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"\n    返回 {tp1, sl}\n\n    2026-06-03 老公指示：止损改为 ATR 动态 + 2% 保底\n    - 止盈：+4%（TP1 全平 100%）\n    - 止损：max(2%, ATR% × 分层倍数)，防止止损价被行情轻易打穿\n      atr_sl_tiers: <2%ATR→1.0x, <4%→1.5x, ≥4%→2.0x\n    - 无 TP2（已废弃）\n    \"\"\"\n    TAKE_PROFIT_PCT = 0.04  # 2026-03-30 老公指示：改回 4%（8U）\n    MIN_SL_PCT      = 0.02  # 保底 2%\n\n    # ── ATR 动态止损距离 ──\n    atr_pct = ind.get(\"atr_pct\", 0) if ind else 0\n    atr_mult = 1.0  # 默认 1 倍\n    if atr_pct > 0:\n        atr_tiers = CONFIG.get(\"atr_sl_tiers\", [(0.02, 1.0), (0.04, 1.5), (9999, 2.0)])\n        for threshold, mult in atr_tiers:\n            if atr_pct < threshold:\n                atr_mult = mult\n                break\n    sl_pct = max(MIN_SL_PCT, atr_pct * atr_mult)\n\n    if direction == \"LONG\":\n        tp1 = entry * (1 + TAKE_PROFIT_PCT)\n        sl  = entry * (1 - sl_pct)\n    else:\n        tp1 = entry * (1 - TAKE_PROFIT_PCT)\n        sl  = entry * (1 + sl_pct)\n\n    return {\n        \"tp1_price\": round(tp1, 4),\n        \"sl_price\":  round(sl, 4),\n        \"peak_pnl\":  0.0,   # 移动止盈用\n    }\n\n\n# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n# 七、止盈止损检查（15秒必跑，极轻量）\n# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\ndef check_exits_fast(positions: list, prices: dict) -> list[tuple]:\n    \"\"\"\n    返回 [(position, reason, close_size_ratio)]\n    纯价格比较，无任何计算，<5ms\n    \n    2026-03-28 老公指示：TP1 全平，无 TP2\n    \"\"\"\n    exits = []\n    for pos in positions:\n        sym = pos[\"symbol\"]\n        p   = prices.get(sym, {}).get(\"price\")\n        if not p:\n            continue\n\n\n[2135 more lines in file. Use offset=632 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780723908404}}
{"type":"message","id":"228b5299","parentId":"0e6ce917","timestamp":"2026-06-06T05:31:51.328Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me also check the mobile stop (trailing stop) logic:","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_sdTdv8JWWpKz4wW4DO2C4185","name":"read","arguments":{"offset":656,"path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py","limit":60}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":747,"output":122,"cacheRead":84992,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":85861,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780723908438}}
{"type":"message","id":"c15a85b8","parentId":"228b5299","timestamp":"2026-06-06T05:31:51.487Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_sdTdv8JWWpKz4wW4DO2C4185","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"def update_trailing_stop(positions: list, prices: dict):\n    \"\"\"\n    移动止盈 - 2026-03-30 老公指示：三档移动止盈（从峰值价回撤）\n    2% → 回撤 0.8% → 锁定 1.2%\n    3% → 回撤 1% → 锁定 2% ⭐️ 老公指示\n    4% → 全平\n    \n    2026-03-31 老公指示：每次更新 sl_price 后同步到 Binance（取消旧单 + 提交新单）\n    \"\"\"\n    for pos in positions:\n        sym = pos[\"symbol\"]\n        p   = prices.get(sym, {}).get(\"price\")\n        if not p:\n            continue\n\n        entry = pos[\"entry_price\"]\n        typ   = pos[\"type\"]\n\n        pnl_pct = (p - entry) / entry if typ == \"LONG\" else (entry - p) / entry\n\n        # 更新峰值盈亏 和 峰值价格\n        if pnl_pct > pos.get(\"peak_pnl\", 0):\n            pos[\"peak_pnl\"] = pnl_pct\n            pos[\"peak_price\"] = p  # ✅ 记录峰值价格\n\n        # 找到当前利润对应的档位（取最高档）\n        active_tier = None\n        peak_pnl = pos.get(\"peak_pnl\", 0)  # ✅ 兼容旧数据\n        for tier in CONFIG[\"trailing_tiers\"]:\n            if peak_pnl >= tier[\"pnl\"]:\n                active_tier = tier\n            else:\n                break\n\n        if not active_tier:\n            continue\n\n        # 4% 全平特殊处理\n        if active_tier.get(\"gap\", 0) >= 0.9:\n            old_sl = pos[\"sl_price\"]\n            pos[\"sl_price\"] = p * 0.999 if typ == \"LONG\" else p * 1.001\n            # 同步到 Binance（取消旧单 + 提交新止损+止盈）\n            sync_stop_loss_to_binance(sym, typ, pos[\"sl_price\"], old_sl, pos.get(\"tp1_price\", 0), qty=abs(pos.get(\"amount\", 0)))\n            continue\n        \n        # 回撤比例（老公指示）- 从峰值价回撤！\n        gap = active_tier[\"gap\"]\n        peak_p = pos.get(\"peak_price\", entry)  # ✅ 用峰值价，不是当前价\n        \n        if typ == \"LONG\":\n            new_sl = peak_p * (1 - gap)  # 峰值价回撤 gap%\n            if new_sl > pos[\"sl_price\"]:\n                old_sl = pos[\"sl_price\"]\n                pos[\"sl_price\"] = round(new_sl, 4)\n                # 同步到 Binance（取消旧单 + 提交新止损+止盈）\n                sync_stop_loss_to_binance(sym, typ, pos[\"sl_price\"], old_sl, pos.get(\"tp1_price\", 0), qty=abs(pos.get(\"amount\", 0)))\n        else:\n            new_sl = peak_p * (1 + gap)  # 峰值价回撤 gap%\n            if new_sl < pos[\"sl_price\"]:\n                old_sl = pos[\"sl_price\"]\n\n[2051 more lines in file. Use offset=716 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780723911449}}
