{"type":"message","id":"5bd12ac6","parentId":"09a1bd1f","timestamp":"2026-06-06T05:31:55.078Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_PBQvteSS1wxVF71NG3YI9369","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\"trailing_tiers\": [\n        {\"pnl\": 0.02, \"gap\": 0.008},  # 2% 时，回撤 0.8% → 锁定 1.2%（2.4U @20U）\n        {\"pnl\": 0.03, \"gap\": 0.01},   # 3% 时，回撤 1% → 锁定 2%（4U @20U）⭐️ 老公指示\n        {\"pnl\": 0.04, \"gap\": 0.999},  # 4% 时，全平 → 锁定 4%（8U @20U）\n    ],\n\n    # ATR止损倍数分层\n    \"atr_sl_tiers\": [\n        (0.02, 1.0),   # ATR% < 2%  →  止损1.0倍ATR\n--\n        for tier in CONFIG[\"trailing_tiers\"]:\n            if peak_pnl >= tier[\"pnl\"]:"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":116,"aggregated":"\"trailing_tiers\": [\n        {\"pnl\": 0.02, \"gap\": 0.008},  # 2% 时，回撤 0.8% → 锁定 1.2%（2.4U @20U）\n        {\"pnl\": 0.03, \"gap\": 0.01},   # 3% 时，回撤 1% → 锁定 2%（4U @20U）⭐️ 老公指示\n        {\"pnl\": 0.04, \"gap\": 0.999},  # 4% 时，全平 → 锁定 4%（8U @20U）\n    ],\n\n    # ATR止损倍数分层\n    \"atr_sl_tiers\": [\n        (0.02, 1.0),   # ATR% < 2%  →  止损1.0倍ATR\n--\n        for tier in CONFIG[\"trailing_tiers\"]:\n            if peak_pnl >= tier[\"pnl\"]:","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1780723915066}}
{"type":"message","id":"4bc917bd","parentId":"5bd12ac6","timestamp":"2026-06-06T05:32:13.545Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have the full picture. Here's the plan:\n\n**改成 ATR 动态止盈的方案：**\n\n在 `calc_tp_sl` 函数中：\n- 当前: `TAKE_PROFIT_PCT = 0.04` 固定\n- 改成: `tp_pct = max(0.04, atr_pct * 1.5)` 动态\n- 上限设个 0.10（10%），防止太离谱\n\n**移动止盈三档也需要同步调整：**\n\n当前：\n- 2% PnL → 回撤 0.8%\n- 3% PnL → 回撤 1%\n- 4% PnL → 全平\n\n如果止盈浮动到 6-10%，那移动止盈的档位也应该等比例放大：\n- 档位 1：tp_pct × 50%  → 回撤 tp_pct × 20%\n- 档位 2：tp_pct × 75%  → 回撤 tp_pct × 33%\n- 档位 3：tp_pct × 100% → 全平\n\n但这有个问题：移动止盈写在 CONFIG 里是静态的，而 tp_pct 是动态的。需要把 trailing_tiers 的计算从静态配置改成动态。\n\n实际上，更简单的方案：保持 trailing_tiers 配置不变但在运行时根据实际 tp_pct 调整。或者，可以把 trailing_tiers 改成比例关系。\n\n让我设计方案，然后跟老公确认再改。\n\n**修改位置：**\n\n只需改一个文件：`crypto_signal_monitor.py`\n\n1. `calc_tp_sl` 函数（line 572）- 止盈 ATR 动态化\n2. CONFIG 中的 `trailing_tiers` - 从固定金额改成比例关系\n3. `update_trailing_stop` 函数 - 适配新的 tiers 格式\n\n让我给老公一个清楚的方案说明。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"只改一个文件 `crypto_signal_monitor.py`，三处：\n\n**1. `calc_tp_sl` 函数** — 止盈从固定 4% 改 ATR 联动\n\n```python\n# 改前:\nTAKE_PROFIT_PCT = 0.04\n\n# 改后:\ntp_pct = max(0.04, min(atr_pct * 2.0, 0.15))\n# 解释: ATR震荡时还是4%，ATR飙到7%+时止盈自动放宽到14%\n# 让止损(ATR×1.5x)和止盈(ATR×2.0x)同源，盈亏比自然保持>1.3:1\n```\n\n**2. `trailing_tiers` 配置** — 从绝对百分比改相对比例\n\n```python\n# 改前: 固定 2%/3%/4%\n{\"pnl\": 0.02, \"gap\": 0.008},  # 盈利2%时回撤0.8%锁定\n{\"pnl\": 0.03, \"gap\": 0.01},   # 盈利3%时回撤1%\n{\"pnl\": 0.04, \"gap\": 0.999},  # 盈利4%全平\n\n# 改后: 相对于止盈的百分比\n{\"pnl_ratio\": 0.50, \"gap_ratio\": 0.20},  # 达到50%止盈目标时,回撤=止盈×20%\n{\"pnl_ratio\": 0.75, \"gap_ratio\": 0.35},  # 达到75%止盈目标时,回撤=止盈×35%\n{\"pnl_ratio\": 1.00, \"gap\": 0.999},       # 达到止盈目标,全平\n```\n\n举例：止盈 8% 时 → 移动止盈档位自动变成 4%/6%/8%\n\n**3. `update_trailing_stop` 函数** — 读 `tp1_price` 反推止盈比例，做档位换算\n\n改动量不大，压缩在 60 行以内。要我动手改吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":272,"output":1336,"cache