{"type":"message","id":"73eb2a23","parentId":"0a5ec2b1","timestamp":"2026-06-06T05:35:27.428Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"老公说没看懂。让我用简单的人话解释一下。\n\n核心就一句话：**止盈不再死定 4%，而是看市场波动大小，波动大就自动放宽，波动小就保持 4%。**\n\n我举例子好了：\n\n现在市场暴跌，ATR（平均波动幅度）飙到 8%：\n- 旧规则：止盈还是 4%，很快就触发了，赚 4% 跑路\n- 新规则：止盈自动调到 8% × 2 = 16%（封顶 15%），让它跑更远\n\n市场平静时，ATR 才 1-2%：\n- 止盈 = max(4%, 2% × 2) = 还是 4%，不变\n\n移动止盈也一样跟着自动缩放——止盈目标大了，每一档也等比放大。\n\n这样解释应该清楚了。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"好，换人话：\n\n**现在的规则**：涨 4% 就卖，不管市场波动多大\n\n**新规则**：止盈距离跟着市场波动走\n\n- 市场平稳 → 还是涨 4% 卖\n- 市场疯了 → 自动放宽到比如 8%、10%，让它多跑一会儿再卖\n\n跟止损一样都是看 ATR（波动率）算的，只是止盈给的倍数更大（2 倍），保证跑得更远。\n\n一个字：**活**。死板 → 灵活的差别。要不要改？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":317,"output":486,"cacheRead":87808,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":88611,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780724117770}}
{"type":"message","id":"f5724580","parentId":"73eb2a23","timestamp":"2026-06-06T05:35:55.242Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6d0f557fa4a0b1ce3d3e35cb2d9\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户124241\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-06-06 13:35 GMT+8\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户124241 (ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"name\": \"用户124241\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6d0f557fa4a0b1ce3d3e35cb2d9]\n用户124241: 那调整吧"}],"timestamp":1780724155215}}
{"type":"message","id":"4167283c","parentId":"f5724580","timestamp":"2026-06-06T05:36:06.720Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"老公说调整。让我动手改代码。\n\n主要修改：\n1. `calc_tp_sl` 函数 - TP 从固定 4% 改为 ATR 动态\n2. `trailing_tiers` 配置 - 从绝对百分比改为相对比例\n3. `update_trailing_stop` 函数 - 适配新的 tiers 格式\n\nLet me start.\n\n### 1. calc_tp_sl - TP ATR 动态\n\nCurrent:\n```python\nTAKE_PROFIT_PCT = 0.04  # 2026-03-30 老公指示：改回 4%（8U）\n```\n\nNew:\n```python\n# 止盈 ATR 动态：保底 4%，ATR 飙升时自动放宽，上限 15%\ntp_pct = max(0.04, min(atr_pct * 2.0, 0.15))\n```\n\nAnd the direction logic:\n```python\nif direction == \"LONG\":\n    tp1 = entry * (1 + tp_pct)\nelse:\n    tp1 = entry * (1 - tp_pct)\n```\n\n### 2. trailing_tiers - 相对比例\n\nCurrent:\n```python\n\"trailing_tiers\": [\n    {\"pnl\": 0.02, \"gap\": 0.008},  # 2% 时，回撤 0.8% → 锁定 1.2%（2.4U @20U）\n    {\"pnl\": 0.03, \"gap\": 0.01},   # 3% 时，回撤 1% → 锁定 2%（4U @20U）⭐️ 老公指示\n    {\"pnl\": 0.04, \"gap\": 0.999},  # 4% 时，全平 → 锁定 4%（8U @20U）\n],\n```\n\nNew - ratio-based:\n```python\n\"trailing_tiers\": [\n    {\"pnl_ratio\": 0.50, \"gap_ratio\": 0.20},   # 达到50%止盈时,回撤=止盈×20%\n    {\"pnl_ratio\": 0.75, \"gap_ratio\": 0.35},   # 达到75%止盈时,回撤=止盈×35%\n    {\"pnl_ratio\": 1.00, \"gap\": 0.999},        # 达到止盈,全平\n],\n```\n\n### 3. update_trailing_stop - 适配\n\nI need to read the existing update_trailing_stop more carefully and rewrite it to use the new config format.\n\nLet me do this step by step.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_etesnMgpOrvxwuVErbqC7412","name":"read","arguments":{"offset":77,"path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py","limit":20}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":470,"output":1242,"cacheRead":88064,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":89776,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780724155234}}
{"type":"message","id":"33aea04f","parentId":"4167283c","timestamp":"2026-06-06T05:36:06.827Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_etesnMgpOrvxwuVErbqC7412","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"    },\n\n    # 基础止盈止损（ATR动态覆盖）\n    \"base_tp_pct\":  0.08,\n    \"base_sl_pct\":  0.05,\n\n    # 移动止盈 - 2026-03-30 老公指示：关闭移动止盈，严格固定 -2% 止损\n    # 2026-03-30 老公指示：三档移动止盈（回撤比例）\n    \"trailing_tiers\": [\n        {\"pnl\": 0.02, \"gap\": 0.008},  # 2% 时，回撤 0.8% → 锁定 1.2%（2.4U @20U）\n        {\"pnl\": 0.03, \"gap\": 0.01},   # 3% 时，回撤 1% → 锁定 2%（4U @20U）⭐️ 老公指示\n        {\"pnl\": 0.04, \"gap\": 0.999},  # 4% 时，全平 → 锁定 4%（8U @20U）\n    ],\n\n    # ATR止损倍数分层\n    \"atr_sl_tiers\": [\n        (0.02, 1.0),   # ATR% < 2%  →  止损1.0倍ATR\n        (0.04, 1.5),   # ATR% < 4%  →  止损1.5倍ATR\n        (9999, 2.0),   # ATR% >= 4% →  止损2.0倍ATR\n    ],\n\n[2670 more lines in file. Use offset=97 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780724166808}}
{"type":"message","id":"260ab1dc","parentId":"33aea04f","timestamp":"2026-06-06T05:36:11.428Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK now I have all the info I need. Let me make the changes:\n\n1. CONFIG trailing_tiers → ratio-based\n2. calc_tp_sl → use ATR for tp_pct\n3. update_trailing_stop → adapt to ratio-based tiers\n\nLet me also read the update_trailing_stop function more completely to understand how it works:","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_GzYSbbE9acdlgkE9IW0J9975","name":"read","arguments":{"offset":656,"path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py","limit":70}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":496,"output":248,"cacheRead":89088,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":89832,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780724166846}}
{"type":"message","id":"b4ff3e88","parentId":"260ab1dc","timestamp":"2026-06-06T05:36:11.513Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_GzYSbbE9acdlgkE9IW0J9975","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"def update_trailing_stop(positions: list, prices: dict):\n    \"\"\"\n    移动止盈 - 2026-03-30 老公指示：三档移动止盈（从峰值价回撤）\n    2% → 回撤 0.8% → 锁定 1.2%\n    3% → 回撤 1% → 锁定 2% ⭐️ 老公指示\n    4% → 全平\n    \n    2026-03-31 老公指示：每次更新 sl_price 后同步到 Binance（取消旧单 + 提交新单）\n    \"\"\"\n    for pos in positions:\n        sym = pos[\"symbol\"]\n        p   = prices.get(sym, {}).get(\"price\")\n        if not p:\n            continue\n\n        entry = pos[\"entry_price\"]\n        typ   = pos[\"type\"]\n\n        pnl_pct = (p - entry) / entry if typ == \"LONG\" else (entry - p) / entry\n\n        # 更新峰值盈亏 和 峰值价格\n        if pnl_pct > pos.get(\"peak_pnl\", 0):\n            pos[\"peak_pnl\"] = pnl_pct\n            pos[\"peak_price\"] = p  # ✅ 记录峰值价格\n\n        # 找到当前利润对应的档位（取最高档）\n        active_tier = None\n        peak_pnl = pos.get(\"peak_pnl\", 0)  # ✅ 兼容旧数据\n        for tier in CONFIG[\"trailing_tiers\"]:\n            if peak_pnl >= tier[\"pnl\"]:\n                active_tier = tier\n            else:\n                break\n\n        if not active_tier:\n            continue\n\n        # 4% 全平特殊处理\n        if active_tier.get(\"gap\", 0) >= 0.9:\n            old_sl = pos[\"sl_price\"]\n            pos[\"sl_price\"] = p * 0.999 if typ == \"LONG\" else p * 1.001\n            # 同步到 Binance（取消旧单 + 提交新止损+止盈）\n            sync_stop_loss_to_binance(sym, typ, pos[\"sl_price\"], old_sl, pos.get(\"tp1_price\", 0), qty=abs(pos.get(\"amount\", 0)))\n            continue\n        \n        # 回撤比例（老公指示）- 从峰值价回撤！\n        gap = active_tier[\"gap\"]\n        peak_p = pos.get(\"peak_price\", entry)  # ✅ 用峰值价，不是当前价\n        \n        if typ == \"LONG\":\n            new_sl = peak_p * (1 - gap)  # 峰值价回撤 gap%\n            if new_sl > pos[\"sl_price\"]:\n                old_sl = pos[\"sl_price\"]\n                pos[\"sl_price\"] = round(new_sl, 4)\n                # 同步到 Binance（取消旧单 + 提交新止损+止盈）\n                sync_stop_loss_to_binance(sym, typ, pos[\"sl_price\"], old_sl, pos.get(\"tp1_price\", 0), qty=abs(pos.get(\"amount\", 0)))\n        else:\n            new_sl = peak_p * (1 + gap)  # 峰值价回撤 gap%\n            if new_sl < pos[\"sl_price\"]:\n                old_sl = pos[\"sl_price\"]\n                pos[\"sl_price\"] = round(new_sl, 4)\n                # 同步到 Binance（取消旧单 + 提交新止损+止盈）\n                sync_stop_loss_to_binance(sym, typ, pos[\"sl_price\"], old_sl, pos.get(\"tp1_price\", 0), qty=abs(pos.get(\"amount\", 0)))\n\ndef _cancel_algo_by_type(symbol_usdt: str, order_type: str):\n    \"\"\"取消某币种指定类型的 Algo 单（不影响另一边）\"\"\"\n    try:\n        result = request(\"GET\", \"/fapi/v1/openAlgoOrders\", {\"symbol\": symbol_usdt})\n        if isinstance(result, list):\n            for o in result:\n\n[2041 more lines in file. Use offset=726 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780724171493}}
{"type":"message","id":"8fdb0072","parentId":"b4ff3e88","timestamp":"2026-06-06T05:36:29.396Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a complete picture. Let me write all three changes:\n\n1. **CONFIG trailing_tiers** → ratio-based\n2. **calc_tp_sl** → ATR dynamic TP\n3. **update_trailing_stop** → adapt to new tier format\n\nThe key insight for `update_trailing_stop`:\n- Old: tiers are absolute (`\"pnl\": 0.02`, `\"gap\": 0.008`)\n- New: tiers are relative (`\"pnl_ratio\": 0.50`, `\"gap_ratio\": 0.20`)\n- Need to compute: tp_pct from entry_price and tp1_price, then multiply\n\nFor each position, we can derive tp_pct = abs(tp1_price - entry_price) / entry_price.\nThen the actual thresholds become:\n- PnL threshold = tp_pct * pnl_ratio\n- Gap = tp_pct * gap_ratio (or 0.999 for the last tier)\n\nLet me implement this now.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"开始改。先改配置："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_OSt36dmBjKsD3d7eS0wb1342","name":"edit","arguments":{"new_string":"    # 移动止盈 - 2026-03-30 老公指示：三档移动止盈（回撤比例）\n    # 2026-06-06 老公指示：改为相对止盈比例（ATR 动态止盈联动）\n    \"trailing_tiers\": [\n        {\"pnl_ratio\": 0.50, \"gap_ratio\": 0.20},   # 达到50%止盈时,回撤=止盈×20%\n        {\"pnl_ratio\": 0.75, \"gap_ratio\": 0.35},   # 达到75%止盈时,回撤=止盈×35%\n        {\"pnl_ratio\": 1.00, \"gap\": 0.999},        # 达到止盈,全平\n    ],","path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py","old_string":"    # 移动止盈 - 2026-03-30 老公指示：关闭移动止盈，严格固定 -2% 止损\n    # 2026-03-30 老公指示：三档移动止盈（回撤比例）\n    \"trailing_tiers\": [\n        {\"pnl\": 0.02, \"gap\": 0.008},  # 2% 时，回撤 0.8% → 锁定 1.2%（2.4U @20U）\n        {\"pnl\": 0.03, \"gap\": 0.01},   # 3% 时，回撤 1% → 锁定 2%（4U @20U）⭐️ 老公指示\n        {\"pnl\": 0.04, \"gap\": 0.999},  # 4% 时，全平 → 锁定 4%（8U @20U）\n    ],"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":934,"output":909,"cacheRead":89728,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":91571,"cost":{"inpu