{"type":"message","id":"ff253a75","parentId":"88d14701","timestamp":"2026-06-06T05:38:40.338Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good - all syntax checks pass. Let me now verify a few things:\n\n1. Check that the old `tp2_price`, `tp1_hit`, `size_remaining` fields are still present where needed\n2. Make sure the load_positions function can handle the new tp_pct field\n3. Run a quick simulation to verify the logic\n\nLet me do a quick verification:","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_7WBYPWBme1XVULhYIIw11106","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 -c \"\n# 快速验证：模拟回调场景看止盈变化\nimport sys, os\nsys.path.insert(0, '.')\n\n# 模拟三种市场状态\ntests = [\n    ('震荡市 ATR=1.2%', 0.012),\n    ('正常波动 ATR=3.0%', 0.030),\n    ('崩盘 ATR=7.5%', 0.075),\n]\n\nprint('=== 止盈 ATR 动态验证 ===')\nfor label, atr in tests:\n    tp_pct = max(0.04, min(atr * 2.0, 0.15))\n    print(f'{label}: 止盈={tp_pct*100:.1f}%')\n\nprint()\nprint('=== 移动止盈档位验证 (以 ATR=7.5%, 止盈=15% 为例) ===')\ntp_pct = 0.15\ntiers = [\n    (0.50, 0.20),\n    (0.75, 0.35),\n    (1.00, 0.999),\n]\nfor pct, gap_ratio in tiers:\n    if gap_ratio >= 0.9:\n        print(f'  档{pct*100:.0f}%止盈进度: 全平')\n    else:\n        print(f'  档{pct*100:.0f}%止盈进度: PnL>{tp_pct*pct*100:.1f}% 时, 回撤={tp_pct*gap_ratio*100:.1f}%')\n\nprint()\nprint('=== 盈亏比验证 (止盈=ATR×2.0, 止损=ATR×分层) ===')\nfor label, atr in [(f'ATR={a}%', a) for a in [1.2, 3.0, 5.0, 7.5]]:\n    sl_mult = 1.0\n    if atr >= 4.0:\n        sl_mult = 2.0\n    elif atr >= 2.0:\n        sl_mult = 1.5\n    tp = atr * 2.0\n    sl = atr * sl_mult\n    print(f'{label}: TP={tp:.1f}% SL={sl:.1f}% 盈亏比={tp/sl:.2f}:1')\n\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":105,"output":733,"cacheRead":101632,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":102470,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780724307808}}
{"type":"message","id":"8ee50128","parentId":"ff253a75","timestamp":"2026-06-06T05:38:40.750Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_7WBYPWBme1XVULhYIIw11106","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"=== 止盈 ATR 动态验证 ===\n震荡市 ATR=1.2%: 止盈=4.0%\n正常波动 ATR=3.0%: 止盈=6.0%\n崩盘 ATR=7.5%: 止盈=15.0%\n\n=== 移动止盈档位验证 (以 ATR=7.5%, 止盈=15% 为例) ===\n  档50%止盈进度: PnL>7.5% 时, 回撤=3.0%\n  档75%止盈进度: PnL>11.2% 时, 回撤=5.2%\n  档100%止盈进度: 全平\n\n=== 盈亏比验证 (止盈=ATR×2.0, 止损=ATR×分层) ===\nATR=1.2%: TP=2.4% SL=1.2% 盈亏比=2.00:1\nATR=3.0%: TP=6.0% SL=4.5% 盈亏比=1.33:1\nATR=5.0%: TP=10.0% SL=10.0% 盈亏比=1.00:1\nATR=7.5%: TP=15.0% SL=15.0% 盈亏比=1.00:1"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":340,"aggregated":"=== 止盈 ATR 动态验证 ===\n震荡市 ATR=1.2%: 止盈=4.0%\n正常波动 ATR=3.0%: 止盈=6.0%\n崩盘 ATR=7.5%: 止盈=15.0%\n\n=== 移动止盈档位验证 (以 ATR=7.5%, 止盈=15% 为例) ===\n  档50%止盈进度: PnL>7.5% 时, 回撤=3.0%\n  档75%止盈进度: PnL>11.2% 时, 回撤=5.2%\n  档100%止盈进度: 全平\n\n=== 盈亏比验证 (止盈=ATR×2.0, 止损=ATR×分层) ===\nATR=1.2%: TP=2.4% SL=1.2% 盈亏比=2.00:1\nATR=3.0%: TP=6.0% SL=4.5% 盈亏比=1.33:1\nATR=5.0%: TP=10.0% SL=10.0% 盈亏比=1.00:1\nATR=7.5%: TP=15.0% SL=15.0% 盈亏比=1.00:1","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1780724320729}}
{"type":"message","id":"62f6db17","parentId":"8ee50128","timestamp":"2026-06-06T05:38:59.738Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The ATR 5%+ case has a 1:1 risk-reward ratio, which isn't great. Let me think about this...\n\nIn very high volatility (ATR >= 4%), the stop loss multiplier is 2.0x. So:\n- ATR=5%: TP=10%, SL=10% (ATR×2.0 for both) → 1:1\n- ATR=7.5%: TP=15%, SL=15% → 1:1\n\nThis is because at high ATR, both TP and SL scale by 2.0x. This means in extreme conditions, the risk-reward is neutral. \n\nBut wait - the SL also has a minimum of 2% floor: `sl_pct = max(MIN_SL_PCT, atr_pct * atr_mult)`. So for ATR=5% with atr_mult=2.0: sl_pct=max(0.02, 0.05*2.0)=max(0.02,0.10)=0.10.\n\nAnd TP: tp_pct=max(0.04, min(0.05*2.0, 0.15))=max(0.04, min(0.10,0.15))=max(0.04,0.10)=0.10.\n\nSo TP=SL=10%, ratio=1:1. That's actually not terrible for extreme conditions - in a crash, you want tight protection. But the TP multiplier at 2.0 might be too conservative. \n\nActually, the original design had TP=4% and SL=max(2%, ATR×mult). In a crash, SL could be 10%+ while TP stayed at 4% → ratio <0.4:1 (terrible!).\n\nSo the new design is already much better. 1:1 in extreme conditions is acceptable. In normal conditions, it's >1.3:1 which is good.\n\nI think this is fine. Let me not over-optimize and move on.\n\nActually, one concern: when ATR is small (like 1.2%), the tp_pct = max(0.04, 0.012*2.0) = max(0.04, 0.024) = 0.04. SL = max(0.02, 0.012*1.0) = max(0.02, 0.012) = 0.02. Ratio = 4/2 = 2:1. This is actually great.\n\nWait, but the test output shows TP=2.4% SL=1.2% for ATR=1.2%. That's wrong - I was using atr_pct directly instead of formatted percentages. Let me re-read:\n\nActually in the test I did:\n```python\ntp = atr * 2.0  # atr=0.012, tp=0.024 = 2.4%\nsl = atr * sl_mult  # atr=0.012, sl=0.012 = 1.2%\n```\n\nBut in the actual code:\n```python\ntp_pct = max(0.04, min(atr_pct * 2.0, 0.15))\n# atr_pct=0.012, tp_pct=max(0.04,0.024)=0.04\nsl_pct = max(0.02, atr_pct * atr_mult)\n# atr_pct=0.012, atr_mult=1.0, sl_pct=max(0.02,0.012)=0.02\n```\n\nSo the actual result is: TP=4%, SL=2%, ratio=2:1. The test was wrong because I didn't account for the floor/ceiling values properly. The actual code is fine.\n\nLet me verify once more with the correct logic:","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"逻辑验证通过。修正一下测试中的止损保底："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_LXjuQoUrLu9Zvv6gycyf9245","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 -c \"\ntests = [\n    ('震荡市 ATR=1.2%', 0.012),\n    ('正常波动 ATR=3.0%', 0.03),\n    ('加速跌 ATR=5.0%', 0.05),\n    ('崩盘 ATR=7.5%', 0.075),\n    ('极端 ATR=10%', 0.10),\n]\nprint('=== 实际止盈止损 (保底/上限已应用) ===')\nfor label, atr in tests:\n    tp_pct = max(0.04, min(atr * 2.0, 0.15))\n    sl_mult = 1.0\n    for t, m in [(0.02,1.0),(0.04,1.5),(9999,2.0)]:\n        if atr < t: sl_mult = m; break\n    sl_pct = max(0.02, atr * sl_mult)\n    print(f'{label}: TP={tp_pct*100:.1f}% SL={sl_pct*100:.1f}% 盈亏比={tp_pct/sl_pct:.2f}:1')\n\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":434,"output":1983,"cacheRead":102272,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":104689,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780724320775}}
{"type":"message","id":"f12b129e","parentId":"62f6db17","timestamp":"2026-06-06T05:39:00.235Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_LXjuQoUrLu9Zvv6gycyf9245","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"=== 实际止盈止损 (保底/上限已应用) ===\n震荡市 ATR=1.2%: TP=4.0% SL=2.0% 盈亏比=2.00:1\n正常波动 ATR=3.0%: TP=6.0% SL=4.5% 盈亏比=1.33:1\n加速跌 ATR=5.0%: TP=10.0% SL=10.0% 盈亏比=1.00:1\n崩盘 ATR=7.5%: TP=15.0% SL=15.0% 盈亏比=1.00:1\n极端 ATR=10%: TP=15.0% SL=20.0% 盈亏比=0.75:1"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":390,"aggregated":"=== 实际止盈止损 (保底/上限已应用) ===\n震荡市 ATR=1.2%: TP=4.0% SL=2.0% 盈亏比=2.00:1\n正常波动 ATR=3.0%: TP=6.0% SL=4.5% 盈亏比=1.33:1\n加速跌 ATR=5.0%: TP=10.0% SL=10.0% 盈亏比=1.00:1\n崩盘 ATR=7.5%: TP=15.0% SL=15.0% 盈亏比=1.00:1\n极端 ATR=10%: TP=15.0% SL=20.0% 盈亏比=0.75:1","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1780724340212}}
{"type":"message","id":"89f3a8ac","parentId":"f12b129e","timestamp":"2026-06-06T05:39:12.104Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The extreme case (ATR=10%) has a bad ratio of 0.75:1. The problem is TP maxes at 15% but SL keeps growing (ATR × 2.0). This could be a problem but it's very rare.\n\nIn practice:\n- ATR=5% to 7.5%: 1:1 ratio, acceptable in extreme conditions\n- ATR=10%: 0.75:1, not great but extremely rare\n\nThe SL is growing unbounded (max = ATR × 2.0) while TP is capped at 15%. I should probably cap the SL too. Let me add a max SL cap.\n\nActually, the original SL design was: `sl_pct = max(MIN_SL_PCT, atr_pct * atr_mult)`. The MIN_SL_PCT=2% is the floor. I should add a MAX_SL_PCT=15% as a ceiling.\n\nLet me add it to calc_tp_sl.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_nXqIprW4Wb4XOzIhubXY5534","name":"edit","arguments":{"new_string":"    TAKE_PROFIT_PCT = 0.04  # 保底 4%（2026-03-30 老公指示）\n    TP_MAX_PCT      = 0.15  # 止盈上限 15%\n    MIN_SL_PCT      = 0.02  # 保底 2%\n    MAX_SL_PCT      = 0.15  # 2026-06-06: 止损上限 15%，防止极端 ATR 下止损失控\n\n    # ── 2026-06-06 老公指示：止盈 ATR 动态，崩盘时自动放宽 ──\n    tp_pct = TAKE_PROFIT_PCT\n    if atr_pct > 0:\n        tp_pct = max(TAKE_PROFIT_PCT, min(atr_pct * 2.0, TP_MAX_PCT))","path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py","old_string":"    TAKE_PROFIT_PCT = 0.04  # 保底 4%（2026-03-30 老公指示）\n    TP_MAX_PCT      = 0.15  # 止盈上限 15%\n    MIN_SL_PCT      = 0.02  # 保底 2%\n\n    # ── 2026-06-06 老公指示：止盈 ATR 动态，崩盘时自动放宽 ──\n    tp_pct = TAKE_PROFIT_PCT\n    if atr_pct > 0:\n        tp_pct = max(TAKE_PROFIT_PCT, min(atr_pct * 2.0, TP_MAX_PCT))"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":237,"output":872,"cacheRead":103808,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":104917,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780724340262}}
