{"type":"message","id":"e3910d58","parentId":"ba1511e9","timestamp":"2026-06-06T05:41:28.208Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"老公问所有逻辑代码是否通过测试。让我做一个完整的端到端验证：\n\n1. 语法检查 ✅ (已通过)\n2. 各函数的逻辑完整性检查\n3. 模拟实际运行场景\n4. 检查所有依赖路径\n\n让我做一个全面的测试。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_ZuBpl8KSumyR5RCnLJwg0885","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 -c \"\nimport py_compile, ast\n\n# 1. 语法\npy_compile.compile('crypto_signal_monitor.py', doraise=True)\nprint('✅ 1. 语法检查')\n\n# 2. 导入依赖检查\nwith open('crypto_signal_monitor.py') as f:\n    tree = ast.parse(f.read())\n\nfuncs = [n.name for n in ast.walk(tree) if isinstance(n, ast.FunctionDef)]\nrequired = ['calc_tp_sl', 'update_trailing_stop', 'open_position', 'close_position',\n            'check_exits_fast', 'submit_initial_algo_orders']\nfor fname in required:\n    assert fname in funcs, f'Missing: {fname}'\nprint(f'✅ 2. 核心函数：{len(funcs)} 个，关键函数全在')\n\n# 3. 配置字段\nimport importlib.util\nspec = importlib.util.spec_from_file_location('monitor', 'crypto_signal_monitor.py')\n# Just check config structure via grep\nimport subprocess\nr = subprocess.run(['grep', '-c', 'tp_pct', 'crypto_signal_monitor.py'], capture_output=True, text=True)\ncount = int(r.stdout.strip())\nassert count >= 5, f'Expected >=5 tp_pct references, found {count}'\nprint(f'✅ 3. tp_pct 引用：{count} 处')\n\n# 4. 模拟 calc_tp_sl\nsys.path.insert(0, '.')\nfrom crypto_signal_monitor import calc_tp_sl\n\nresult = calc_tp_sl(100.0, 'LONG', {'atr_pct': 0.03}, {})\nassert 'tp_pct' in result, 'Missing tp_pct in result'\nassert result['tp_pct'] == 0.06, f'Expected 0.06, got {result[\\\"tp_pct\\\"]}'\nprint(f'✅ 4. calc_tp_sl: tp_pct={result[\\\"tp_pct\\\"]}, tp={result[\\\"tp1_price\\\"]:.2f}, sl={result[\\\"sl_price\\\"]:.2f}')\n\n# 5. 边界测试\nfor atr, expected_tp in [(0.01, 0.04), (0.02, 0.04), (0.03, 0.06), (0.05, 0.10), (0.10, 0.15)]:\n    r = calc_tp_sl(100.0, '