{"type":"message","id":"8c7c4fad","parentId":"2d501255","timestamp":"2026-06-06T05:49:47.354Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me analyze what I'm seeing:\n\n1. Monitor process is running (PID 3218 & 4266 - 2 processes is normal, multi-threaded)\n2. Start-up looks clean: 1 position (BTC SHORT) synced, old Algo orders cancelled, new ones submitted\n3. BTC stop loss submitted at $61,172 (entry $59,972) - that seems wrong for a SHORT. Wait...\n\nFor a SHORT position:\n- Stop loss should be ABOVE entry (to limit losses if price goes up)\n- Take profit should be BELOW entry (to take profit if price goes down)\n\nBTC entry: $59,972.70\nSL: $61,172.154 → about 2% above entry ✅ (that's correct for SHORT, loss if goes up)\nTP: $57,573.792 → about 4% below entry ✅ (that's correct for SHORT, profit if goes down)\n\nWait but the new code should be using ATR dynamic TP. Let me check - the ATR might be low right now (around 1-2%), so TP = 4% (floor). That makes sense.\n\nLet me also check the stop loss percentage:\nSL = 61172.154 / 59972.70 - 1 = 0.02 = 2%. OK that's the min floor.\n\nTP = 1 - 57573.792/59972.70 = 0.04 = 4%. OK floor.\n\nActually wait - these are using the OLD code since the monitor was just restarted. No wait, the code file was edited BEFORE restart. Let me double check by looking at the actual calc_tp_sl call with current ATR.\n\nLet me just check the current ATR to verify the tp_pct is correct.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_5knElJ4YM7nmQhuxoUEW3653","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 -c \"\nimport json, os\n# 检查 BTC 的 ATR 和当前止盈止损\ntry:\n    with open('positions.json') as f:\n        pos = json.load(f)\n    if pos:\n        p = pos[0]\n        tp_pct = p.get('tp_pct', 'N/A')\n        entry = p['entry_price']\n        tp1 = p['tp1_price']\n        sl = p['sl_price']\n        tp_real = abs(tp1 - entry) / entry * 100\n        sl_real = abs(sl - entry) / entry * 100\n        print(f'BTC SHORT @ {entry}')\n        print(f'TP: {tp1} ({tp_real:.1f}%)')\n        print(f'SL: {sl} ({sl_real:.1f}%)')\n        print(f'tp_pct 字段: {tp_pct}')\nexcept FileNotFoundError:\n    print('positions.json 未生成')\n\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":423,"output":1021,"cacheRead":58112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":59556,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780724974656}}
