{"type":"message","id":"2e8453cf","parentId":"0470a4b5","timestamp":"2026-06-06T05:51:48.833Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All tests passed. Let me summarize:\n\n1. No old `tier[\"pnl\"]` or `tier[\"gap\"]` references remain - fully migrated\n2. New format working correctly with the right calculations\n3. Old data (positions without tp_pct) auto-detects from tp1_price - backward compatible\n4. `**tp_sl` expansion includes tp_pct correctly in all paths\n5. Monitor already running with new code - no crashes\n\nNo conflicts found.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"放心，没冲突 👑\n\n排查结果：\n\n| 检查项 | 结果 |\n|:---|:---|\n| 旧 `tier[\"pnl\"]` 引用 | 0 处残留 |\n| `update_trailing_stop` | 已用新格式 |\n| 旧数据兼容（无 tp_pct 字段） | 自动从 tp1_price 反推 ✅ |\n| `**tp_sl` 展开 | tp_pct 自动传递到所有路径 ✅ |\n| `open_position` / `need_rebuild` | 字段自动包含 ✅ |\n| monitor 实际运行 | 正常，无崩溃 ✅ |\n\n旧数据（比如现在 BTC SHORT 没有 tp_pct）进来时 `update_trailing_stop` 会自动 `abs(tp1_price - entry) / entry` 算出 4%，等于和老代码一模一样。新开的仓位才会带 ATR 动态值 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":719,"output":400,"cacheRead":62848,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":63967,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780725100146}}
