{"type":"message","id":"180546c4","parentId":"b9aca261","timestamp":"2026-06-06T05:57:56.968Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All tests pass. The key result: at TP=4% (current BTC situation), the second tier is back to PnL>3% → 回撤1.0%, exactly matching the old version.\n\nLet me summarize the final state of the three tiers across different market conditions.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"全过。现在三档和旧版完全对齐：\n\n| 止盈 | 第1档 | 第2档 | 第3档 |\n|:---|:---|:---|:---|\n| 4%（现在） | PnL>2%, 回撤 0.8% | PnL>**3%**, 回撤 **1%** ✅ | 全平 |\n| 6% | PnL>3%, 回撤 1.2% | PnL>4.5%, 回撤 1.5% | 全平 |\n| 10% | PnL>5%, 回撤 2% | PnL>7.5%, 回撤 2.5% | 全平 |\n\n4% 止盈时第 2 档 = 老版一模一样。`kj` 重启生效 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":265,"output":312,"cacheRead":67328,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":67905,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780725470346}}
