{"type":"message","id":"6ff4b23a","parentId":"3147ff23","timestamp":"2026-06-06T05:59:01.259Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"老公问最高是不是10%。让我再看看——止盈上限是15%不是10%。\n\n我们设置的：\n- `TP_MAX_PCT = 0.15` — 止盈上限 15%\n- `MAX_SL_PCT = 0.15` — 止损上限 15%\n- 止盈 = max(4%, min(ATR×2.0, 15%))\n\n所以上限是15%，不是10%。老公可能从表格里看到10%的例子。让我解释清楚。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"不，上限是 **15%**。刚才表格只列到 10% 是举例。\n\n完整区间：\n\n```\nATR 1.2% → 止盈 4%  （保底）\nATR 3%   → 止盈 6%\nATR 5%   → 止盈 10%\nATR 7.5% → 止盈 15% （触顶）\nATR 10%+ → 止盈 15% （锁死）\n```\n\n代码里是 `min(ATR × 2.0, 0.15)`，15% 封顶。如果嫌低也可以改。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":1700,"output":349,"cacheRead":66432,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":68481,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780725534951}}
{"type":"message","id":"d339396a","parentId":"6ff4b23a","timestamp":"2026-06-06T05:59:34.543Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6d0f3aa9cca0b1d9b41f3e30953\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户124241\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-06-06 13:59 GMT+8\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户124241 (ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"name\": \"用户124241\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6d0f3aa9cca0b1d9b41f3e30953]\n用户124241: 不低了,亏损那边怎么算的?"}],"timestamp":1780725574510}}
{"type":"message","id":"1cd4a86e","parentId":"d339396a","timestamp":"2026-06-06T05:59:43.403Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"老公问亏损（止损）那边怎么算的。让我整理清楚。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"止损也是 ATR 联动，比止盈收得更紧：\n\n```\nATR < 2%  → 止损 = max(2%, ATR × 1.0)  → 保底 2%\nATR 2-4%  → 止损 = ATR × 1.5           → 比如 ATR=3% → 止损 4.5%\nATR ≥ 4%  → 止损 = ATR × 2.0           → 比如 ATR=5% → 止损 10%\n上限 15%\n```\n\n对比一目了然：\n\n| ATR | 止盈（宽） | 止损（紧） | 止盈买得划算？ |\n|:---|:---|:---|:---|\n| 1.2% | 4% | 2% | ✅ 2:1 |\n| 3% | 6% | 4.5% | ✅ 1.33:1 |\n| 5% | 10% | 10% | ⚖️ 1:1 |\n| 7.5% | 15% | 15% | ⚖️ 1:1 |\n\n逻辑就是：市场越疯，止盈止损越宽松，但保持至少不亏。平稳市赚得多（2:1），崩盘市保平（1:1）—— 不死就有机会 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":468,"output":328,"cacheRead":68096,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":68892,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780725574538}}
