{"type":"message","id":"c11fd7f1","parentId":"bebde55b","timestamp":"2026-06-06T14:24:37.519Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"So XRP was stopped out at -2.15% (-3.23U). Let me calculate the full PnL today:\n\nSOL TP1: +8.23U\nETH TP1: +14.47U\nLINK TP1: ~+8U\nBTC SL: -3.66U\nXRP SL: -3.23U\n\nTotal: +8.23 + 14.47 + 8 + (-3.66) + (-3.23) = +23.81U\n\nCurrent unrealized: -4.79U\n\nSo the user probably saw -12U including both realized losses and unrealized. Let me give a clean summary.\n\nThe user is stressed because the market bounced against the shorts. But positions are still alive, only one hit SL (XRP). The DOT signal is interesting - 60分 SHORT at 22:00 but can't open because already 3/4 positions and it needs higher score.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"XRP 止损了，没 12U 那么惨：\n\n```\n已平仓:\n  SOL TP1  +8.23U ✅\n  ETH TP1  +14.47U ✅\n  LINK TP1 +~8U    ✅\n  BTC SL   -3.66U\n  XRP SL   -3.23U\n  已实现: +23.81U\n\n当前持仓:\n  ETH  SHORT  -2.31U\n  BNB  SHORT  -1.25U\n  LINK SHORT  -1.22U\n  浮亏:  -4.78U\n```\n\n赚的 23.8U 盖浮亏 4.8U 绰绰有余。只是下午反弹对着空单冲了一波，浮亏看着吓人。\n\n而且 22:00 评分 DOT 60 分 SHORT 信号出来了，说明趋势在往下跌方向走。忍住 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":698,"output":607,"cacheRead":76800,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":78105,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780755868030}}
